## What was built

### Flow structure

```
[Manual Trigger]
      │
      ▼
[Mock PO Data]          ← hardcodes PO-2024-0042 / Acme Supplies Ltd / $14,750
      │
      ▼
[Review PO]             ← HITL QuickForm — you see the PO, fill in Notes, click Approve or Reject
      │ completed
      ▼
[Approved?]             ← Decision node — branches on $vars.reviewPO1.status === "approve"
    /       \
 true       false
  │           │
  ▼           ▼
[Log         [Rejected — End]   ← flow stops here, nothing logged
 Approval]
  │
  ▼
[Done]
```

---

### HITL node — `reviewPO1`

**What you'll see (read-only):**

| Field | Value source |
|---|---|
| PO Number | `mockPOData1.output.poNumber` → `"PO-2024-0042"` |
| Vendor Name | `mockPOData1.output.vendorName` → `"Acme Supplies Ltd"` |
| Total Amount | `mockPOData1.output.totalAmount` → `14750` |

**What you fill in:**

| Field | Type | Required |
|---|---|---|
| Notes | string | No |

**Buttons:** **Approve** (primary) · **Reject**

**Timeout:** 24 hours (platform default) · **Priority:** Low

---

### Edges wired

| From | Port | To | Port |
|---|---|---|---|
| `start` | `output` | `mockPOData1` | `input` |
| `mockPOData1` | `success` | `reviewPO1` | `input` |
| `reviewPO1` | `completed` | `checkDecision1` | `input` |
| `checkDecision1` | `true` (Approved) | `logApproval1` | `input` |
| `checkDecision1` | `false` (Rejected) | `endRejected1` | `input` |
| `logApproval1` | `success` | `endApproved1` | `input` |

---

### Runtime variables (for downstream use)

| Path | Contains |
|---|---|
| `$vars.reviewPO1.status` | `"approve"` or `"reject"` |
| `$vars.reviewPO1.output.notes` | The notes you typed |
| `$vars.logApproval1.output.message` | `"PO PO-2024-0042 was approved."` |

